  "description": "1000W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000Plus-up is driven by a powerful 48V 1000W rear brushless motor, providing strong and consistent acceleration up to 25 km/h, effortlessly handling all kinds of terrain.\n\n48V 17.5Ah Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000Plus-up comes with an 840Wh removable Li-ion battery, offering up to 60 km in full electric mode and 120 km with pedal assist, making it ideal for daily commuting and longer rides.\n\nFour-link Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi X3000Plus-UP is equipped with a full suspension system, including front forks and rear shocks, which effectively absorb impacts from rocks, roots, and uneven terrain, providing a smooth and controlled ride on all trails.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
